{{Debuffnotes
| name = Frostbite
| desc = The {{M|True Sight}} component affects [[debuff immune]] units.
}}

 * {{Symbol|fx|v}}
** All ability effects are applied immediately despite the visual effects, and cannot be {{M|disjointed}}.

* {{Symbol|Modifier|Debuff}} {{Code|crystal_maiden_frostbite}}
** Applies the following ability effects as one debuff on the affected enemy unit at the same time:
*** {{M|Bind}}
**** {{M|Disarm}}
**** {{M|Root}}
*** {{M|True Sight}} over the debuff-affected enemy unit.
** Reapplying the debuff refreshes the duration.
** Deals {{#expr:{{#var:Frostbite value1}}*{{#var:Frostbite basic1}}}} ({{Symbol|Lane Creeps}} {{#expr:{{#var:Frostbite value1}}*{{#var:Frostbite basic1}}*{{#var:Frostbite type1 value1}}}}) {{M|magical}} {{M|spell damage}} to the affected enemy unit {{#var:Frostbite basic1}}-second intervals over the entire duration, over {{calc|v1/{{#var:Frostbite basic1}}|v1={{#var:Frostbite value2}}}} ({{Symbol|bonus t4r}} {{ValueColor||{{calc|v1/{{#var:Frostbite basic1}}|v1={{#var:Frostbite value2 tal}}}}|25tal}}) damage instances.

* Considers the following units as enemy heroes:
** {{M|Ancient creeps}}.
** {{M|Clones}}
** {{M|Creep-heroes}}
** {{M|Illusions}}
** {{M|Roshan}}
** The {{M|Tormentor}}.

 {{Gamedesc
| image = {{#var:Frostbite icon0}}
| desc = Encases an enemy unit in ice, prohibiting movement and attack, while dealing damage over time. Deals 4x damage to non-ancient creeps.
}}
* Deals up to the following {{M|spell damage}} values ([[before reductions]]):
** {{calc|v1*{{#var:Frostbite value1}}|v1={{#var:Frostbite value2}}}} ({{Symbol|bonus t4r}} {{ValueColor||{{calc|v1*{{#var:Frostbite value1}}|v1={{#var:Frostbite value2 tal}}}}|25tal}}) damage.
** {{calc|v1*{{#var:Frostbite value1}}*{{#var:Frostbite type1 value1}}|v1={{#var:Frostbite value2}}}} ({{Symbol|bonus t4r}} {{ValueColor||{{calc|v1*{{#var:Frostbite value1}}|v1={{#var:Frostbite value2 tal}}}}|25tal}}) damage to creeps.

* {{cf|Cos}} Has a different {{M|cast backswing}} with the following cosmetic items equipped:
** 0.8 with the {{Cl|Frost Avalanche|Crystal Maiden}} equipped.
** 1 with the {{Cl|Conduit of the Blueheart|Crystal Maiden}} equipped.

