fields.value:
{{Splblocknotes
| name = Crystal Clone
| desc = The passive applied {{A|Crystal Maiden|Frostbite}} does not proc [[Spell Block]] sources.
}}
{{Splreflectnotes
| name = Crystal Clone
| desc = The passive applied {{A|Crystal Maiden|Frostbite}} does not proc [[Spell Reflection]] sources.
}}
{{Draftnotes
| name = Crystal Clone
| desc = Requires drafting {{Symbol|bonus shd}} {{A|Crystal Maiden|Freezing Field}} to unlock this ability.<br><br>{{Symbol|bonus agh}} Requires drafting {{A|Crystal Maiden|Frostbite}} for its corresponding component to work.
}}

 * Acquiring {{M|Aghanim's Shard}} unlocks this ability in the {{Spellslot|4|5}}.

* {{Symbol|Affect|Self}}
** Does not interrupt Rylai's {{M|channeling}} abilities upon cast.

* The ability effects are applied as follows:
*# {{Symbol|Crystal Clone}} {{to}} {{Symbol|fx|v}}
*#* Creates an [[illusion]] immediately at Rylai's current position, despite the visual effects.
*#* Overrides all attack orders and move orders.
*#* {{Symbol|Vision|Base}}
*#** Grants a non-lingering {{Show|H|Crystal Maiden|visionday}} {{M|daytime}} and {{Show|H|Crystal Maiden|visionnight}} {{M|nighttime}} [[vision]] centered around the illusion.
*# {{Symbol|Affect|Self}}
*#* {{M|Disjoint}} incoming {{M|projectiles}}.
*#* Applies a self non-disabling {{M|forced movement}} toward the {{Symbol|Target|Point}} {{Symbol|Target|Vector}} point-targeted vector direction, and can move over other units and {{M|impassable terrain}} in the direction Rylai is {{M|Facing Angle|text=facing}}.

* {{Symbol|Crystal Clone}}
** The created [[illusion]] has the following properties:
*** Does not [[Hero Animations|animate]].
*** Uncontrollable
*** {{M|Untargetable}}
*** Has no {{M|magic resistance}}.
*** However, enemy units can still attack the illusion with a {{Symbol|Target|Ground}} ground-targeted attack on the nearest unit.
** {{Symbol|Kill|Instant}}
*** [[Instant kills]] the illusion and applies {{A|Crystal Maiden|Frostbite}} of its corresponding level within the radius accordingly in the following conditions:
**** Upon expiring.
**** Once it accumulates {{#var:Crystal Clone type1 value}} damage ([[before reductions]]).
***** The following sources damage the created illusion regardless of {{M|faction}}:
****** {{A|Crystal Maiden|Crystal Nova}}
****** {{A|Crystal Maiden|Freezing Field}}
*** Frostbite notes apply.
**** Works independently of Frostbite's {{M|cooldown}}, and does not cost {{M|mana}}.
**** Does not proc {{M|on-cast effects}}.

 {{Gamedesc
| image = {{#var:Crystal Clone icon0}}
| desc = Slides in a direction, creating a crystal clone of herself in her place and disjointing incoming projectiles. If the clone takes enough damage or times out, it shatters, Frostbiting enemies in a 450 AoE around its place. The Clone can also be destroyed by Crystal Maiden's own spells.
}}
* {{Symbol|Forced Movement}}
** The [[forced movement]] applied moves Rylai in the  {{Symbol|Target|Vector}} vector-targeted direction at {{#expr:{{#var:Crystal Clone value2}}/{{#var:Crystal Clone value3}} round2}}-speed, over {{#var:Crystal Clone value3}} seconds upon cast.

* {{Symbol|Crystal Clone}}
** The created [[illusion]] additionally has the following properties:
*** {{M|Taunt}} sources indefinitely affect the illusion regardless of its {{M|debuff}} duration.
*** Certain abilities that do not affect {{M|untargetable}} units do not affect the illusion.
*** The created illusion's {{M|current health}} corresponds to Rylai's {{M|current health|x}}.
**** If Rylai has {{Code|< {{#var:Crystal Clone type1 value}}}} health upon illusion creation, the Crystal Clone shatters before reaching its damage threshold, and applies all other ability effects.
*** In this case, the Crystal Clone grants its illusion bounty, and is defined as:
**** {{cf|expr}} {{Code|{{G|illusion bounty level factor}} × [[Illusion#Bounty|Illusion]]<sub>LVL</sub>}}

