fields.value:
{{Stealnotes
| name = Stop Freezing Field
| desc = Grants {{A|Crystal Maiden|Freezing Field}} if this {{M|sub-ability}} is the last cast ability.
}}

 * {{Symbol|a|sub}}
** Replaces {{A|Crystal Maiden|Freezing Field}} until this {{M|sub-ability}} is used or until the ability's max duration.
** Interrupts Rylai's {{M|channeling}} abilities upon cast.
** Goes into a {{#var:Stop Freezing Field cd}}-second {{M|cooldown}} upon Freezing Field is cast.

* {{Symbol|a|Counter}} {{to}} {{Symbol|Affect|Enemy}}
** The timer resets upon being reapplied to a valid enemy unit.
*** Therefore the affected enemy unit has to be affected by the timer {{M|aura}} continuously up to {{#var:Stop Freezing Field type1 value2}} seconds for {{A|Crystal Maiden|Frostbite}} to be applied.
** The Frostbite applied this way has the following properties:
*** Can only affect the same enemy units once per cast.
*** Works independently of Frostbite's {{M|cooldown}}, and does not cost {{M|mana}}.
*** Does not proc {{M|on-cast effects}}.
** Reapplying the Frostbite {{M|debuff}} refreshes the duration.

* {{Symbol|Affect|Self}}
** Applies the self {{M|movement speed}} slow upon cast.
** Freezing Field is still interrupted by the following sources:
*** {{M|Cyclone}} sources.
*** {{M|Fear}} sources.
*** {{M|Hex}} sources.
*** {{M|Silence}} sources.
*** {{M|Sleep}} sources.
*** {{M|Stun}} sources.
*** Upon the {{M|sub-ability}} cast.
*** Upon Rylai's {{M|death}}.
** No longer is interrupted by the following sources:
*** {{A|Elder Titan|Earth Splitter}}
*** {{A|Disruptor|Glimpse}}
*** {{A|Vengeful Spirit|Nether Swap}}
*** {{A|Treant Protector|Overgrowth}}
*** {{A|Io|Relocate}}
*** {{A|Keeper of the Light|Recall}}
*** {{M|Taunt}} sources.
*** {{A|Kunkka|X Marks the Spot}}
*** {{A|Sniper|Assassinate}}

